sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Streamlit
    participant Query as QueryService
    participant DB as Repository
    participant Search as Retriever/FAISS
    participant LLM as Gemini
    User->>UI: Question
    UI->>Query: Authenticated principal and bounded questions
    Query->>Query: Validate and acquire pipeline lock
    Query->>DB: Read ready document IDs
    Query->>Search: Embed and search with filters
    Search-->>Query: Ranked passages and timings
    alt Safe evidence available
        Query->>LLM: System rules plus untrusted evidence
        LLM-->>Query: Structured claims and quotes
        Query->>Query: Validate source labels and quotes
    else No evidence
        Query->>Query: Abstain without calling LLM
    end
    Query->>DB: Commit query and source audit
    DB-->>Query: Commit success
    Query-->>UI: Answer and evidence
    UI-->>User: Plain text with source expanders
